Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

spec/zyte-openapi.json
  Zyte API's OpenAPI document ("Web Data Extraction API", contact: Zyte), taken from Zyte's public
  API reference: https://docs.zyte.com/zyte-api/usage/reference.html
  It is included for interoperability: xyte implements the same request and response format, and
  its types are generated from it. It remains the work of Zyte Group Ltd and is not covered by
  xyte's MIT License. One upstream typo is patched (ProductNavigation.required was nested under
  properties). It is not part of the npm package.

src/zyte.gen.ts
  TypeScript types generated from spec/zyte-openapi.json with openapi-typescript
  (https://github.com/openapi-ts/openapi-typescript, MIT).

src/schemas.gen.ts
  Zyte's AI-extraction output schemas (product, article, job posting…), extracted from
  spec/zyte-openapi.json by scripts/gen-schemas.ts, so an LLM can return data in the same shape.

The npm package has no runtime dependencies. Optional peer dependencies (playwright, undici, and
the browsers and services you configure) are installed and licensed separately.
